Z||000003||ThatRickGuy||10-15-2000||02:17 PM||||Arg, someone at the hoby shop was playing. when I went back yestarday, I looked at the water pump again, I noticed the bolts were loose... someone had flipped the pully arround! grrrr! I felt stupid after that. Everything is back in. just gotta finish putting the breaks back together and burp the coolant. should be starting it up this afternoon.||||reg||1
